# Implementation constraints

Spec source: [SPEC-gateway-mvp](https://github.com/coragate/coragate-docs/tree/main/docs/specs/gateway-mvp).

Public README is English; Chinese is `README.zh-CN.md` (ADR-0009). Production godoc and Go tests are English.

## Must

- Chat stream stays in Go: `POST /v1/chat/completions` must not enter a Next Route Handler / rewrite / BFF
- Scale the dataplane next to callers (local / sidecar / cluster replica); docs must show both `hosts/client` and `hosts/cluster`
- Control plane only calls dataplane `/v1/inspect`, `/v1/rules`, `/v1/audit`; do not reimplement matching in Next
- Commits cite `SPEC-gateway-mvp#AC-n`

## Must Not

- Do not write a README that conflicts with the docs repo
- Do not prescribe the dataplane as a single company-wide URL
- Do not weld SQLite table DDL into `kernel/`
